(with \code{\link[=spice_run]{spice_run()}}, \code{\link[=spice_session]{spice_session()}}, \code{\link[=spice_sweep]{spice_sweep()}} or
\code{\link[=spice_pss]{spice_pss()}}) is refused with a \code{spice_error_pic} condition, as
\verb{dune pic --run} refuses it.
